{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>In the seventh month</b> — defective yod, meaning: sated with commandments." "<b>You shall sound the shofar throughout</b> — rashei tevot: Shabbat, to teach that specifically the teki'at yovel which is in the court overrides Shabbat."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {0 "The word שביעי is written without a yod; Ba'al HaTurim reads the defective spelling as hinting that the seventh is 'sated' (שבע) with commandments."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:30.717485284Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}